{"suttaId":"sn12.48","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-ii","vriCode":"s0302m.mul","paras":[365,371],"vripara":"48"},"segments":{"sn12.48:0.3":"Lokāyatikasuttaṃ","sn12.48:1.1":"Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati.","sn12.48:1.2":"Atha kho lokāyatiko brāhmaṇo yena bhagavā…pe…","sn12.48:1.3":"ekamantaṃ nisinno kho lokāyatiko brāhmaṇo bhagavantaṃ etadavoca –","sn12.48:2.1":"“Kiṃ nu kho, bho gotama, sabbamatthī”ti?","sn12.48:2.2":"“‘Sabbamatthī’ti kho, brāhmaṇa, jeṭṭhametaṃ lokāyataṃ”.","sn12.48:3.1":"“Kiṃ pana, bho gotama, sabbaṃ natthī”ti?","sn12.48:3.2":"“‘Sabbaṃ natthī’ti kho, brāhmaṇa, dutiyametaṃ lokāyataṃ”.","sn12.48:4.1":"“Kiṃ nu kho, bho gotama, sabbamekatta”nti?","sn12.48:4.2":"“‘Sabbamekatta’nti kho, brāhmaṇa, tatiyametaṃ lokāyataṃ”.","sn12.48:5.1":"“Kiṃ pana, bho gotama, sabbaṃ puthutta”nti?","sn12.48:5.2":"“‘Sabbaṃ puthutta’nti kho, brāhmaṇa, catutthametaṃ lokāyataṃ”.","sn12.48:6.1":"“Ete te, brāhmaṇa, ubho ante anupagamma majjhena tathāgato dhammaṃ deseti –","sn12.48:6.2":"‘avijjāpaccayā saṅkhārā;","sn12.48:6.3":"saṅkhārapaccayā viññāṇaṃ…pe…","sn12.48:6.4":"evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa samudayo hoti.","sn12.48:6.5":"Avijjāya tveva asesavirāganirodhā saṅkhāranirodho;","sn12.48:6.6":"saṅkhāranirodhā viññāṇanirodho…pe…","sn12.48:6.7":"evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa nirodho hotī’”ti.","sn12.48:7.1":"Evaṃ vutte, lokāyatiko brāhmaṇo bhagavantaṃ etadavoca –","sn12.48:7.2":"“abhikkantaṃ, bho gotama…pe…","sn12.48:7.3":"ajjatagge pāṇupetaṃ saraṇaṃ gata”nti.","sn12.48:7.4":"Aṭṭhamaṃ. 9."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-ii","bookName":"Nidānavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0302a.att","from":282,"to":282,"paras":[{"para":282,"vripara":"48","refs":["sn12.48:1","sn12.48:2","sn12.48:4","sn12.48:5"],"lines":["Aṭṭhame <b>lokāyatiko</b>ti vitaṇḍasatthe lokāyate kataparicayo.","<b>Jeṭṭhametaṃ lokāyata</b>nti paṭhamaṃ lokāyataṃ.","<b>Lokāyata</b>nti ca lokasseva āyataṃ, bālaputhujjanalokassa āyataṃ, mahantaṃ gambhīranti upadhāritabbaṃ parittaṃ bhāvaṃ diṭṭhigataṃ.","<b>Ekatta</b>nti ekasabhāvaṃ, niccasabhāvamevāti pucchati.","<b>Puthutta</b>nti purimasabhāvena nānāsabhāvaṃ, devamanussādibhāvena paṭhamaṃ hutvā pacchā na hotīti ucchedaṃ sandhāya pucchati.","Evamettha “sabbamatthi, sabbamekatta”nti imā dvepi sassatadiṭṭhiyo, “sabbaṃ natthi, sabbaṃ puthutta”nti imā dve ucchedadiṭṭhiyoti veditabbā.","Aṭṭhamaṃ. 9."],"lineRefs":[["sn12.48:1"],["sn12.48:2"],["sn12.48:2"],["sn12.48:4"],["sn12.48:5"],["sn12.48:5"],["sn12.48:5"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn12.48:1.2","lokāyatiko",0,0],["sn12.48:2.2","jeṭṭhametaṃ lokāyataṃ",0,1],["sn12.48:2.2","lokāyataṃ",0,2],["sn12.48:4.1","ekattaṃ",0,3],["sn12.48:4.2","ekattaṃ",0,3],["sn12.48:5.1","puthuttaṃ",0,4],["sn12.48:5.2","puthuttaṃ",0,4]],"before":[{"para":281,"vripara":null,"title":"Lokāyatikasuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Lokāyatikasuttavaṇṇanā 48."]}]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-ii","bookName":"Nidānavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0302t.tik","from":296,"to":296,"paras":[{"para":296,"vripara":"48","refs":["sn12.48:1","sn12.48:3","sn12.48:4","sn12.48:5"],"lines":["Āyatiṃ hitaṃ tena loko na yatati na īhatīti lokāyataṃ.","Na hi taṃ laddhiṃ nissāya sattā puññakiriyāya cittampi uppādenti, kuto payogo, taṃ etassa atthi, tattha vā niyuttoti <b>lokāyatiko</b>.","Paṭhamasaddo ādiatthavācakattā jeṭṭhavevacanoti āha <b>“paṭhamaṃ lokāyata”</b>nti.","Sādhāraṇavacanopi lokasaddo visiṭṭhavisayo idhādhippetoti āha <b>“bālaputhujjanalokassā”</b>ti.","Ittarabhāvena lakuṇḍakabhāvena tassa vipulādibhāvena bālānaṃ upaṭṭhānamattanti dassento <b>“āyataṃ mahanta”</b>ntiādimāha.","<b>Paritta</b>nti khuddakaṃ.","<b>Ekasabhāva</b>nti ekaṃ sabhāvaṃ.","Avipariṇāmadhammatāyāti āha <b>“niccasabhāvamevāti pucchatī”</b>ti.","<b>Purimasabhāvena nānāsabhāva</b>nti purimasabhāvato bhinnasabhāvaṃ.","<b>Pacchā na hotī</b>ti pacchā kiñci na hoti sabbaso samucchijjanato.","Tenāha <b>“ucchedaṃ sandhāya pucchatī”</b>ti.","<b>Ekatta</b>nti sabbakālaṃ attasambhavaṃ.","Tathā ceva gahaṇena <b>dvepi</b> vādā <b>sassatadiṭṭhiyo</b> honti.","<b>Natthi</b> na hoti.","<b>Puthuttaṃ</b> nānāsabhāvaṃ, ekarūpaṃ na hotīti vā gahaṇena <b>dvepi</b> vādā <b>ucchedadiṭṭhiyo</b>ti."],"lineRefs":[["sn12.48:1"],["sn12.48:1"],["sn12.48:1"],["sn12.48:1"],["sn12.48:1"],["sn12.48:1"],["sn12.48:1"],["sn12.48:1"],["sn12.48:1"],["sn12.48:1"],["sn12.48:1"],["sn12.48:4"],["sn12.48:4"],["sn12.48:3"],["sn12.48:5"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn12.48:1.2","lokāyatiko",0,1],["sn12.48:4.1","ekattaṃ",0,11],["sn12.48:4.2","ekattaṃ",0,11],["sn12.48:3.1","natthi",0,13],["sn12.48:3.2","natthi",0,13],["sn12.48:5.1","puthuttaṃ",0,14],["sn12.48:5.2","puthuttaṃ",0,14]],"after":[{"para":297,"vripara":null,"title":"Lokāyatikasuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Lokāyatikasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 9."]}]},"tika2":null}
